# I47 (REVIEW-PHASE1-R20): the agent's build outputs must not ride into the
# verified commit (the commit is pushed to the repo by S6 delivery). The
# runner's commitWorkspace refuses any NEW file over 1 MiB or binary — but
# the SEED repo should carry its own .gitignore so a `go build` output (the
# 2.5 MB gocli binary) is ignored at staging time (the runner's guard is the
# backstop for a .gitignore-less workspace). This file is committed into the
# seeded repo (hack/samples-seed.sh seeds from the committed tree), so the
# gocli Loop's workspace has it from the base commit.
/gocli
*.exe
